      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert Hiring Manager evaluating a candidate for an open requisition.\nI will provide you with the required Job Description JSON and the candidate's Resume JSON.\n\nCompare the two and score the candidate out of 20 points for each of the 5 sections (Experience, Education, Technical Skills, Qualifications, Projects).\n\nCRITICAL RULE (Anti-Keyword Stuffing): Cross-verify the candidate's \"technical_skills\". If a candidate lists a skill but does not explicitly show evidence of applying it within their \"experience\" or \"projects\" sections, heavily deduct points for that skill.\n\nBase your grading entirely on how well the candidate's background fulfills the specific requirements outlined in the Job Description provided.\n\nReturn a strict JSON object with these exact keys:\n\n\"experience_score\" (0-20)\n\n\"education_score\" (0-20)\n\n\"skills_score\" (0-20)\n\n\"qualifications_score\" (0-20)\n\n\"projects_score\" (0-20)\n\n\"fitment_score\" (The total sum of the 5 scores, out of 100)\n\n\"summary\" (A 2-sentence explanation of your grading, explicitly stating what the candidate matched or lacked)\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nRequired Job Description:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Clean JD JSON').item.json) }}\n\nCandidate Resume:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {}
